    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for a JIT linker. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_j_i_t_linker_base" kindref="compound">JITLinkerBase</ref> instance links one object file into an ongoing JIT session. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_symbol" kindref="compound">Symbol</ref> resolution and finalization operations are pluggable, and called using continuation passing (passing a continuation for the remaining linker work) to allow them to be performed asynchronously. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
